{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obliterate tens of thousands of enemies who dared to challenge you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.poster.avif?t=1774055207\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.webm?t=1774055207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.mp4?t=1774055207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/ea6ffea9e1c94b2006ea21ff48dade1b.poster.avif?t=1774055207\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/ea6ffea9e1c94b2006ea21ff48dade1b.webm?t=1774055207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/ea6ffea9e1c94b2006ea21ff48dade1b.mp4?t=1774055207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, equipment, upgrades and melees to discover each time new <strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry <strong>up to 11 weapons at once</strong> and improve them by eliminating <strong>ever stronger enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/equipments.gif?t=1774055207\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/classes.gif?t=1774055207\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/09fdaae7563c4d0793ef42bb0385a391.poster.avif?t=1774055207\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/09fdaae7563c4d0793ef42bb0385a391.webm?t=1774055207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/09fdaae7563c4d0793ef42bb0385a391.mp4?t=1774055207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>105</strong> upgrades, <strong>30</strong> unlockable equipment, <strong>15</strong> deck cards, and <strong>11</strong> artifact weapons to build your <strong>OP</strong> arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all enemies, face mini-bosses, and win by defeating the <strong>Archon of Red</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6</strong> different mini-bosses that teleport, grab, summon enemies, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4</strong> classes, each with <strong>4</strong> weapons to suit any playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches lasting <strong>15</strong> minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9</strong> difficulty levels, including <strong>Madness</strong>, <strong>One-Shot</strong>, <strong>Continuous Elite</strong>, and <strong>Infinite Survival</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls to unlock new upgrades and fragments to enhance your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy minerals scattered across the map for small stat bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-aim and manual fire, with faster movement when not shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide through almost anything without taking damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>familiars</strong> that automatically gather resources, block, and attack enemies.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Madness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/a25e98c5f643e236ff57e7332c742ef29495425c.jpg"},{"name":"Graveyard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/e19fb93832bccd7128b9db7f5f177ccbf179fb9a.jpg"},{"name":"Pistol Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/6a7c725b4f8f03d2c355183bf9147bc5000a4550.jpg"},{"name":"\"Heavy machine gun!\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/bf9ac52e7884ede447467e1964b4484cc547847a.jpg"},{"name":"\"Until it is done\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/514fa44453c8990bbca4054553a4f1a4908062ad.jpg"},{"name":"The beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/6686692e9e76441b4dca79616c3f3cb754283f8b.jpg"},{"name":"Lemme prepare better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/6fd5b381a51259945e6fa4cb437473e5f20cfa5c.jpg"},{"name":"Uh! Shiny!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714400/afa99d7cdc66d51614c584b4cd21561b2526773c.jpg"},{"name":"Get out of there","path"